---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import Callout from '../components/Callout.astro';
import ReviewNote from '../components/ReviewNote.astro';
import { actions } from '../config/site';
const crumbs = [{ label: 'About', href: '/about/' }, { label: 'Safety & privacy', href: '/safety/' }];
---
<PageLayout
  title="Safety &amp; privacy"
  description="How Club Pamoja protects members: where member records are kept, how to recognize official communication, and how to stay safe from scams."
  eyebrow="Safety"
  lede="Member and family records are sensitive. Here is how Club Pamoja keeps them separate from this public website, and how to protect yourself."
  breadcrumbs={crumbs}
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="split">
        <div class="split__head"><p class="eyebrow">Your records</p><h2>Kept in the member portal.</h2></div>
        <div class="prose">
          <p>This public website does not hold member records. Registered family members, beneficiary details and membership information are managed in the separate member portal, reached through <strong>{actions.signIn.label}</strong>.</p>
          <p>This website does not use advertising or analytics cookies.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="split">
        <div class="split__head"><p class="eyebrow">Stay safe</p><h2>Recognizing scams.</h2></div>
        <div class="prose">
          <p>Communities that support one another financially can be targeted by impostors. Protect yourself:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Only sign in through the <strong>{actions.signIn.label}</strong> button on this website. Check the address in your browser before entering your password.</li>
            <li>Never share your password or one-time codes with anyone, including someone claiming to be from Club Pamoja.</li>
            <li>Be cautious of urgent requests for money sent through personal messages or social media. Confirm any request directly with administration.</li>
            <li>Contribution amounts are fixed and published on the <a href="/contributions-fees/">Contributions &amp; fees</a> page. Treat any request for a different amount with suspicion.</li>
          </ul>
          <ReviewNote id="CR-19">Confirm official payment channels and official communication channels (email domain, phone, social accounts) so they can be listed here.</ReviewNote>
          <Callout tone="notice" title="Something look wrong?">
            <p>If you receive a suspicious request, do not pay. <a href="/contact/">Contact Club Pamoja administration</a>.</p>
          </Callout>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</PageLayout>
